---
interface Props {
  variant?: 'full' | 'compact';
}
const { variant = 'full' } = Astro.props;
const topics = ['Azure', 'DevOps', 'Cloud Infrastructure', 'Cybersecurity', 'AI', 'Microsoft Foundry'];
const stats = [
  { value: '30+', label: 'Free sessions' },
  { value: '₦0', label: 'Cost to attend' },
  { value: 'Sep 2025', label: 'Running since' },
];
---

<section id="zero-to-hero" class:list={['z2h', variant]}>
  <div class="z2h-head">
    <p class="z2h-eyebrow">Giving back</p>
    <h2>Zero to Hero <span>· free technical training</span></h2>
  </div>

  <div class="z2h-body">
    <div class="z2h-text">
      {
        variant === 'full' ? (
          <>
            <p>
              One experience that strongly resonates with any organisation's mission is my work delivering free
              technical training through my <strong>Zero to Hero</strong> programmes. Since last year 2025 September, I
              have delivered <strong>30+ hands-on training sessions</strong> and counting at no cost, helping
              participants build practical skills across Azure cloud technologies, DevOps, cloud infrastructure,
              cybersecurity, AI and Microsoft Foundry.
            </p>
            <p>
              I started these programmes because I wanted to make practical, industry-relevant technology education
              more accessible to people who may not otherwise have the opportunity or resources to access it. Rather
              than focusing only on theory, I provide hands-on learning and practical guidance that participants can
              apply in real-world environments.
            </p>
            <p>
              This experience has reinforced my belief that technology can be a powerful tool for inclusion and
              economic opportunity when knowledge and access are made available to more people. That closely aligns
              with any company’s mission of using technology and innovation to expand access and improve lives,
              particularly in underserved markets.
            </p>
          </>
        ) : (
          <>
            <p>
              Since September 2025, I have delivered <strong>30+ hands-on training sessions</strong> and counting at
              no cost through my <strong>Zero to Hero</strong> programmes, helping participants build practical skills
              across Azure, DevOps, cloud infrastructure, cybersecurity, AI and Microsoft Foundry.
            </p>
            <p>
              I believe technology can be a powerful tool for inclusion and economic opportunity when knowledge and
              access are made available to more people.
            </p>
            <a href="/about#zero-to-hero" class="z2h-link">Read the full story →</a>
          </>
        )
      }
      <ul class="z2h-topics">{topics.map((t) => <li>{t}</li>)}</ul>
    </div>

    <div class="z2h-stats">
      {
        stats.map((s) => (
          <div>
            <strong>{s.value}</strong>
            <span>{s.label}</span>
          </div>
        ))
      }
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .z2h {
    position: relative; overflow: hidden; padding: 2.25rem; border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
    border: 1px solid color-mix(in srgb, var(--color-accent) 45%, var(--color-border));
    background:
      radial-gradient(ellipse 60% 80% at 100% 0%, color-mix(in srgb, var(--color-accent) 12%, transparent), transparent 70%),
      var(--color-bg-card);
  }
  .z2h-eyebrow {
    display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 0.75rem; margin: 0 0 0.6rem; font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.75rem; letter-spacing: 0.2em; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--color-accent);
  }
  .z2h-eyebrow::before { content: ''; width: 28px; height: 1px; background: var(--color-accent); }
  h2 { margin: 0 0 1.5rem; font-size: clamp(1.5rem, 3.5vw, 2rem); }
  h2 span { color: var(--color-text-muted); font-weight: 600; font-size: 0.6em; }
  .z2h-body { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 220px; gap: 2.5rem; align-items: start; }
  .z2h-text p { color: var(--color-text-muted); line-height: 1.75; margin: 0 0 1rem; }
  .z2h-text strong { color: var(--color-text); }
  .z2h-link { display: inline-block; margin-bottom: 1.25rem; font-weight: 600; color: var(--color-accent); }
  .z2h-topics { list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 0.5rem 0 0; display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 0.5rem; }
  .z2h-topics li {
    font-family: var(--font-mono); font-size: 0.72rem; padding: 0.3rem 0.7rem; border-radius: 100px;
    border: 1px solid var(--color-border); color: var(--color-accent);
  }
  .z2h-stats { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 0.75rem; }
  .z2h-stats div {
    display: flex; flex-direction: column; padding: 1rem 1.1rem; border-radius: var(--radius-md);
    border: 1px solid var(--color-border); background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--color-bg) 60%, transparent);
  }
  .z2h-stats strong { font-size: 1.6rem; font-weight: 800; color: var(--color-accent); line-height: 1.2; }
  .z2h-stats span { font-size: 0.8rem; color: var(--color-text-muted); }
  @media (max-width: 860px) {
    .z2h { padding: 1.5rem; }
    .z2h-body { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 1.5rem; }
    .z2h-stats { flex-direction: row; flex-wrap: wrap; }
    .z2h-stats div { flex: 1 1 90px; padding: 0.8rem; }
    .z2h-stats strong { font-size: 1.15rem; white-space: nowrap; }
  }
</style>
